</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Requirement</th><th>How LinkedHashMap satisfies it</th></tr>
<tr><td>Fast lookup by key</td><td>Hash table backing (like HashMap)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Duplicate keys not allowed</td><td>Map contract</td></tr>
<tr><td>Predictable iteration order</td><td>Insertion order preserved</td></tr>
